   "html": "<section class=\"block card xpulse-card\"><h2>X analyst pulse <span class=\"tag\">X · Nov 1</span></h2><div class=\"xp-verdict neg\"><div class=\"xp-verdict-main\"><span class=\"xp-verdict-lbl\">Crowd read</span><span class=\"xp-verdict-txt\">Analysts lean <strong>defensive</strong></span></div><div class=\"xp-verdict-meta\"><span class=\"xp-count pos\">0 bullish</span><span class=\"xp-count warn\">2 neutral</span><span class=\"xp-count neg\">3 bearish</span><span class=\"src-chip diverge\">Diverges with our Cautious regime</span></div></div><ul class=\"xp-list\"><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2116582324519518427\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @glassnode\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2116582324519518427.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">flows</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">US spot ETH ETFs have logged 23 straight sessions of outflows, the longest streak since launch, after heavy buying in August and September.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2116582324519518427\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@glassnode</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 31</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2116582324519518427\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2116452743099388133\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @Darkfost_Coc\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2116452743099388133.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Short-term holders sent more than 36 600 BTC to exchanges at a loss within 24 hours of the $76 000 test.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2116452743099388133\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 31</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2116452743099388133\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2115908106484093016\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @glassnode\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2115908106484093016.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Altcoin buyers went from the biggest profit-taking spike since December 2024 in late September back to selling most tokens at a loss a month…</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2115908106484093016\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@glassnode</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 29</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2115908106484093016\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2115708993691877875\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @AxelAdlerJr\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2115708993691877875.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">macro</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">After the Oct.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2115708993691877875\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@AxelAdlerJr</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 29</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2115708993691877875\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/cryptoquant_com/status/2115723150201618746\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @cryptoquant_com\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2115723150201618746.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Bitcoin exchange netflow turned positive for the first time since September 21, meaning holders stopped withdrawing.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/cryptoquant_com/status/2115723150201618746\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@cryptoquant_com</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 29</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/cryptoquant_com/status/2115723150201618746\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li></ul><p class=\"xp-note\">Curated data-first analysts only · paraphrased, not advice</p></section>"
